  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1301/275/mrpg-lib_title-png.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/loader-fabric|neoforge-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-rpg-classes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fAShKd5XrTu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffichteee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/donations-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/ProfessorFichte/Elemental-Wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p><hr><h2>🚨必備模組</h2><p>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a>（以及 Spell Engine 的所有依賴模組！）<br>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Power Attributes</a></p><hr><h3>🌟<strong>特色功能</strong></h3><p>- 此模組本身不新增法術，您需要安裝想要的職業模組來為遊戲新增法術<br>- 此模組主要作為「更多 RPG 職業與內容系列模組」的函式庫使用<br>- 不同 RPG 職業使用的獨特實體屬性<br>- 不同 RPG 職業使用的新狀態效果</p><p>更多關於此函式庫的資訊可參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/ProfessorFichte/More-RPG-Library/blob/1.21.1/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><hr><h3><strong>🧙‍♂️查看我使用此函式庫開發的 RPG 主題模組</strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/709/archers_expansion_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/710/berserker_mod_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/711/elemental_wizards_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/712/forcemaster_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/713/witcher_mod_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><hr><h2><strong>想體驗更多 RPG 內容？查看 Daedelus 創建的 RPG 系列模組！</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"聖騎士\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"巫師\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盜賊\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠寶\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遺物\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"軍械庫\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"武器庫\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能樹\"></a></p><hr><h2><strong>查看其他 Spell Engine 開發者創建的更多 RPG 內容</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"無政府狀態\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"傭兵與工匠\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡騎士\"></a></p>",
